# Pairs with FlipDeletesNothing. A flip to off must take effect by not
# consulting the tenant layer, never by deleting what tenants authored.
MODULE: FlipOffPurgesTenantRules
TARGET: FlipDeletesNothing
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: turning the flag off deletes the tenant-tier rules
PERTURBS: FlipFlag

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED vreq
    /\ UNCHANGED Stores
--- REPLACE
    /\ UNCHANGED vreq
    /\ rules' = IF flag[s] THEN {r \in rules : r.layer # "tenant"} ELSE rules
    /\ UNCHANGED <<clusterGroups, tenantGroups, edges, adminEntries, memberEntries, budget>>
--- END
